      "content": "thanks, that makes sense. i definitely haven't been sleeping much lately. do u think i should try taking any supplements to help with the focus? i saw some stuff online about high doses of melatonin or maybe even some herbal things like ashwagandha to help with the stress/fog combo. would anything like that be safe to do on my own?",
